    xkos:plainText "Excludes:\n• Agricultural labour input (103)\n• Government expenditure for agriculture, forestry and fishing (20103)\n• Forest resource assessment (20105)\n• Environmental accounting for agriculture, forestry and fishing (20105)\n• Forest fire (304)."@en ;
