<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/csa2/20304> xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/csa2/20304/note/coreContentNote> .
<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/csa2/20304/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Covers statistical activities on all modes of domestic transport (air, rail, road, inland waterways, sea, pipelines); includes topics like transport infrastructure, equipment, traffic flows, personal mobility, safety, transport accidents, energy consumption, transport enterprises, passengers and freight transport, transport sector trends, road traffic accidents."@en ;
