<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/csa2/20305> xkos:coreContentNote <http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/csa2/20305/note/coreContentNote> .
<http://classif-mcp.local/unsd/csa2/20305/note/coreContentNote> a xkos:ExplanatoryNote ;
    xkos:plainText "Covers statistical activities regarding visitor activity (such as arrivals/departures, overnight stays, expenditures, purpose of the visit, etc.) associated with different forms of tourism (inbound, domestic and outbound), tourism industries activity and infrastructure, and employment as reported by tourism industries."@en ;
    dct:source <https://unstats.un.org/unsd/classifications/CSA2/CSA2_Exp_Notes.xlsx> ;
    skos:editorialNote "Explanatory notes of CSA 2.0 as published by UNSD. Converted by classif-mcp; check against the source file."@en .

